      "source": [
        "# Unary operations\n",
        "\n",
        "Unary `+` and `-` apply numeric signs; `~` performs bitwise inversion. For integers, `~x` equals `-(x + 1)`.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "31742776b4c10582",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "(-3, +3, ~3)  # (-3, 3, -4)\n"
